ion; Incident Response Services to prepare and respond to potential breaches; Threat Intelligence; Managed Digital Risk Protection; Exposure Command, an exposure management to provide attack surface visibility; and Command Essentials to provide strong security for workloads leveraging real-time visibility, identity analysis, and automated remediation. In addition, it provides Surface Command, a Cyber Asset Attack Service Management solution to detect and prioritize security issues from endpoint to cloud; Vector Command, a continuous red-teaming service that validates the external attack surface exposures and tests defenses; Rapid7 Cloud Security, a cloud risk and compliance management solution; Rapid7 Application Security, a dynamic application security testing tool; and Rapid7 Vulnerability Management, a vulnerability management solution that provides visibility across on-premise and remote endpoints for security. Further, it offers offloads day-to-day, advisory, and professional services. The company was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts.","employees":2613,"website":"https://www.rapid7.com","country":"United States","city":"Boston","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Corey E. Thomas","title":"Executive Chairman"},{"name":"Mr. Wael  Mohamed","title":"CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Rafeal Edgar Brown CPA","title":"Chief Financial Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.36,"tpe":29.57,"ps":4.323,"pfcf":25.98,"peg":1.09,"pb":4.666,"ev_ebitda":19.21,"rev_growth":0.185,"eps_growth":0.3665,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2411,"eps_growth_next":0.1798,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.125,"roa":0.04945,"de":32.75,"gross_margin":0.5312,"op_margin":0.1357,"profit_margin":0.09441,"current_ratio":1.873},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":null,"sector":17.36,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":71.29,"sector":29.57,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.207,"sector":4.323,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","